{"study_accession":"PRJNA871225","secondary_study_accession":"SRP393101","title":"Transcription profiling of PfSPZ Vaccine trial subjects (US, malaria naïve) receiving a 3-dose or 5-dose regimen","description":"The Sanaria® PfSPZ Vaccine can confer sterilizing protection against liver stage infection by Plasmodium falciparum (Pf) in malaria naïve individuals. The vaccine consists of aseptically purified irradiated Pf sporozoites. Vaccinees received either 3 doses of 1.8M irradiated sporozoites or 5 doses of 270K. Efficacy was measured by challenged by controlled human malaria infections (CHMI) at 3 weeks and 24 weeks after the last vaccine dose Overall design: 30 samples from 2 time points, pre-vaccination (Day -7) and post-vaccination (Day 116(3-dose vaccinees) or day 143 (5-dose vaccinees)), for 15 US adult participants who received the PfSPZ vaccine. All 15 participants remained uninfected after the first CHMI, while only 7 participants remained uninfected after both CHMI","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":30,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN30412406","study_accession":"PRJNA871225","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"S1049_D114","description":"S1049_D114","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6481605","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-08-23","attributes":[["source_name","Whole blood"],["tissue","Whole blood"],["day","Day 114"],["outcome","MoreProtected"],["time","PostVaccination"],["treatment","3 doses of 1.8M PfSPZ sporozoites"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR21145525","experiment_accession":"SRX17157539","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":68994359,"base_count":17386578468,"first_public":"2022-08-23","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM6481605: S1049_D114 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN30412407","study_accession":"PRJNA871225","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","t